{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's Health and Wellness Column", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Self-Made Athlete", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe unusual events through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future with <span class=\"italic\">Will </span>and <span class=\"italic\">Be Going To</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you want to talk about facts or things you believe to be true about the future, you use <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I <span class=\"strong\">will not be able to </span>become an athlete overnight.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>. These are things that you have thought about and predict for the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">m going to do</span> everything I can to get in shape.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I won't go on being inadequate and lethargic.</li><li>I'll be lucky if I can run around the block. </li><li>In a couple of months, I'll be able to run a few miles.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Be Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I'm going to buy myself a bicycle.</li><li>First of all, I'm going to begin running.</li><li>My friend George is going to run with me.  </li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>A <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> is a verb ending with<span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">running</span>, <span class=\"italic\">breathing</span>, <span class=\"italic\">jumping</span>, <span class=\"italic\">playing</span>.<br/>An <span class=\"strong\">infinitive </span>is when a verb is preceded by the word <span class=\"italic\">to</span>. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">to run</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to breath</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to jump</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to play</span>. </p><p>There are rules about which verbs are followed by gerunds and which verbs are followed by infinitives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Verbs commonly followed by a gerund:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>like</li><li>love</li><li>enjoy</li><li>dislike</li><li>hate</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use gerunds after prepositions, for example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">After becoming </span>members, George and I will work out at the gym every afternoon. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are some verbs that are followed by an infinitive:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>hope</li><li>aim</li><li>would like</li><li>decide</li><li>help</li><li>happen</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">plan to run </span>every morning.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use infinitives after adjectives. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I am <span class=\"strong\">determined to change</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'd like to try cross-training. That should help me beef up. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Eventually, I'll be a real athlete, and who knows, maybe I'll even begin to enjoy playing sports. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm in pretty bad physical condition, but I am determined to change that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I plan to run every morning.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lethargic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without much energy; lazy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I won't go on being inadequate and lethargic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about staying healthy.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "block ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the section of a city between two streets", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll be lucky if I can run around the block. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to beef up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to increase or improve, usually physically", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That should help me beef up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cross-training", "type": "name"}, {"content": "physical exercise in two or more activities", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to try cross-training. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "member ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is part of a club, organization, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: George and I will become members at the gym.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "athlete ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person with high skills in physical agility and strength", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Eventually, I'll be a real athlete.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and research a person who is a self-made success (an athlete, a millionaire, an entrepreneur).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a brief summary of their biography (100-120 words) including your perception regarding their achievements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your biography with your partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your opinion about their life.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about my attitude toward a self-made person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify why the person is a self-made success.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my opinion with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le12ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "", "id": 1, "text": "I'm in pretty bad physical condition, but I am determined to change that. From now on, I'm going to do everything I can to get in shape. I know that I won't be able to become an athlete overnight, but I am going to turn myself into one, even if it takes time. Nothing is going to stop me. I won't go on being inadequate and lethargic."}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "", "id": 2, "text": "Tomorrow morning, I'm going to begin my new way of life. First of all, I'm going to begin running. I plan to run every morning. My friend George is going to run with me. We probably won't be able to run very far at first. I'll be lucky if I can run around the block. That doesn't worry me, because I know that I'll improve. In a couple of months, I'll be able to run a few miles.<br/>\nThere's one more thing that I'm going to do. Next spring, I'm going to buy myself a bicycle. At first, George and I will take short trips. Slowly, the trips will get longer and longer. Eventually, we'll bike from city to city."}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "", "id": 3, "text": "I know that running and bike-riding aren't enough, so I have other plans as well. Soon, George and I will have enough money to join a gym. After becoming members, George and I will work out at the gym every afternoon. I'd like to try cross-training. That should help me beef up. Eventually, I'll be a real athlete, and who knows, maybe I'll even begin to enjoy playing sports."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le12ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le12ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "I'm in pretty bad physical condition, but I am determined to change that. From now on, I'm going to do everything I can to get in shape. I know that I won't be able to become an athlete overnight, but I am going to turn myself into one, even if it takes time. Nothing is going to stop me. I won't go on being inadequate and lethargic."}, {"image": "", "time": "20200", "id": 2, "text": "Tomorrow morning, I'm going to begin my new way of life. First of all, I'm going to begin running. I plan to run every morning. My friend George is going to run with me. We probably won't be able to run very far at first. I'll be lucky if I can run around the block. That doesn't worry me, because I know that I'll improve. In a couple of months, I'll be able to run a few miles.<br/>\nThere's one more thing that I'm going to do. Next spring, I'm going to buy myself a bicycle. At first, George and I will take short trips. Slowly, the trips will get longer and longer. Eventually, we'll bike from city to city."}, {"image": "", "time": "57900", "id": 3, "text": "I know that running and bike-riding aren't enough, so I have other plans as well. Soon, George and I will have enough money to join a gym. After becoming members, George and I will work out at the gym every afternoon. I'd like to try cross-training. That should help me beef up. Eventually, I'll be a real athlete, and who knows, maybe I'll even begin to enjoy playing sports."}], "video_src": "engenn8le12ob09re2vid02"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about staying healthy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future plans. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you know of any self-made successful people in your country? What did they do to become successful?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you have any future plans related to your health? What are they?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"conten